{"id":"01a04583-b25d-79b8-96db-9e8c181078ca","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.10.1.3","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.10.1.3\",\"title\":\"Zephyr: CoAP message parse/serialize\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:45:55.303472Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-27T23:04:21.487335Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-26T19:09:09.594274Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-27T23:09:21.487335Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-27T23:04:21.487335Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.10.1.3\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.10.1\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:45:55.858696Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Implemented allocation-free RFC 7252 message codec in coap_codec.c/.h with zero-copy parse, canonical bounded serialization, token/options/payload handling, extended delta/length forms, cumulative-option overflow checks, malformed/truncated/reserved rejection, and failure atomicity. Added shared coap_messages.json vector consumer plus focused edge tests in lichen/tests/coap_codec and narrow CoAP build wiring. Validation: host Apple clang ASan/UBSan ctest 1/1 PASS; local Zephyr 4.1 qemu_x86 4/4 PASS (used approved verification-only -Wno-error=duplicated-branches for unrelated Zephyr logging macro warning; production warnings remained fatal); Python CoAP vector/property scope 60 passed, 1 skipped, 3 expected xfailed; Rust coap_rfc_vectors 3/3 PASS with unique target dir; ruff clean; scoped git diff --check clean. Pinned Zephyr 3.7 clone is unavailable locally per AGENTS, so the allowed Zephyr 4.1 smoke gate was used.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-27T23:17:33.917638Z"}
